-- Exact bipartite trace Tr(psi psi^T) and purity numerator Tr((psi psi^T)^2) on subsystem A vs subsystem B:
qent-tr1-A : (I J A : Type) → A → (A → A → A) → (A → A → A) → (I → J → A) → List I → List J → A
qent-tr1-A I J A z add mul psi is js =
  qent-sum I A z add (λ i → qent-sum J A z add (λ j → mul (psi i j) (psi i j)) js) is
